<p>Your mastery of arcane flows allow you to reset the cooldown of up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> of your spells (that don't have a fixed cooldown) of tier <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 4</acronym> or less.</p><p>In addition for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 6, 7</acronym> turns you are overflowing with energy; all known spells are considered one talent level higher when casting them.</p>